      >
        <Specimen name=".prose-sanfor" props="wrapper class for Markdown / MDX bodies">
          <div class="prose-sanfor">
            <h2>A second-level heading</h2>
            <p>
              Body copy is set in Sora at a 68ch measure. Links inside prose take
              <a href="#prose"> the accent colour</a> and thicken their underline on hover.
              Inline code looks like <code>--signal</code> and stays on one line.
            </p>
            <h3>A third-level heading</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Unordered items get a small signal bullet</li>
              <li>Drawn as a pseudo-element, not a list marker</li>
              <li>So the spacing is ours to control</li>
            </ul>
            <ol>
              <li>Ordered items keep a mono marker</li>
              <li>Which lines numerals up with the rest of the UI</li>
            </ol>
            <blockquote>
              <p>Art is soft, atmospheric and heavily textured. UI is sharp, thin and quiet.</p>
              <cite>AGENTS.md, section 4.1</cite>
            </blockquote>
            <h4>A fourth-level heading</h4>
            <pre><code>{`int main() {
  // Code blocks sit on --ink with a hairline border
  // and scroll horizontally rather than widen the page.
  return 0;
}`}</code></pre>
            <table>
              <thead>
                <tr><th>Token</th><th>Role</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>--ink</td><td>Base background</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--frost</td><td>Main text</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--signal</td><td>Accent</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <hr />
            <p>
              Text can be <strong>emphasised</strong>, <mark>marked</mark>, or annotated with an
              <abbr title="Abbreviation">abbr</abbr>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </Specimen>
      </KitGroup>

      <footer class="kit-footer">
        <Text variant="small" tone="muted">
          Tokens in <InlineCode>src/styles/tokens.css</InlineCode> ·
          components in <InlineCode>src/components/ui/</InlineCode> ·
          docs in <InlineCode>docs/ui-kit.md</InlineCode>
        </Text>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <Toast position="bottom-right" />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .kit-skip {
